《最佳路人》 (The Best Strangers) — music video

Song
  《最佳路人》, from the album 《反婚宇宙》: the film-maker's own song, used as the entire soundtrack
  (no voice-over, score or sound effects were added; loudness normalised to -14 LUFS).

