  Licence texts: fonts/NotoSansSC-OFL.txt, fonts/Jost-OFL.txt

Picture
  Drawn entirely in code (Canvas 2D plates + a WebGL2 print shader); no images, footage or generated video.
  engine/riso.js and engine/draw.js are adapted from the risograph demo engine of the lemo-opuscar library
  (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT licence.

Timing data
  Beat grid: librosa. Lyric timing: faster-whisper large-v3 (timing only; the words are the official lyric sheet).

No real people, brands or logos appear. "凯迪拉克" is a word in the lyric and is shown only as text.
